{"page":"PRKDC","gene":"PRKDC","accession":"P78527","protein":"DNA-dependent protein kinase catalytic subunit","length":4128,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"P78527-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000314191.7"],"refseq":["NM_006904.7"],"refseqProteins":["NP_008835.5"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":null},"features":[{"type":"Modified residue","start":117,"end":117,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Repeat","start":288,"end":323,"description":"HEAT 1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":511,"end":511,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":687,"end":687,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":828,"end":828,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":841,"end":841,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":893,"end":893,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Repeat","start":1004,"end":1040,"description":"HEAT 2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1065,"end":1065,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1209,"end":1209,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Region","start":1503,"end":1538,"description":"Interaction with C1D"},{"type":"Region","start":1503,"end":1538,"description":"Leucine-zipper"},{"type":"Repeat","start":1723,"end":1756,"description":"TPR 1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1970,"end":1970,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Site","start":2020,"end":2021,"description":"Cleavage; by caspase-3"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2056,"end":2056,"description":"Phosphoserine; by autocatalysis"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2259,"end":2259,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Region","start":2436,"end":3212,"description":"KIP-binding"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2535,"end":2535,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2609,"end":2609,"description":"Phosphothreonine; by autocatalysis"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2612,"end":2612,"description":"Phosphoserine; by autocatalysis"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2638,"end":2638,"description":"Phosphothreonine; by autocatalysis"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2647,"end":2647,"description":"Phosphothreonine; by autocatalysis"},{"type":"Region","start":2737,"end":2765,"description":"May split the end of the DNA molecule, with the two strands separating around the region"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2789,"end":2789,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":2906,"end":3539,"description":"FAT"},{"type":"Repeat","start":2920,"end":2948,"description":"TPR 2"},{"type":"Repeat","start":2949,"end":2982,"description":"TPR 3"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3205,"end":3205,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3241,"end":3241,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3260,"end":3260,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3621,"end":3621,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3638,"end":3638,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3642,"end":3642,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Domain","start":3722,"end":4053,"description":"PI3K/PI4K catalytic"},{"type":"Region","start":3728,"end":3734,"description":"G-loop"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3731,"end":3731,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3821,"end":3821,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Region","start":3919,"end":3927,"description":"Catalytic loop"},{"type":"Region","start":3939,"end":3964,"description":"Activation loop"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":4026,"end":4026,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":4096,"end":4128,"description":"FATC"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"DNA-PK is a heterotrimer of PRKDC and the Ku dimer (composed of XRCC6/Ku70 and XRCC5/Ku86) (PubMed:15758953, PubMed:25670504). Formation of this complex may be promoted by interaction with ILF3 (PubMed:9442054). Component of the core long-range non-homologous end joining (NHEJ) complex (also named DNA-PK complex) composed of PRKDC, LIG4, XRCC4, XRCC6/Ku70, XRCC5/Ku86 and NHEJ1/XLF (PubMed:15758953, PubMed:25670504, PubMed:33854234, PubMed:34352203). Additional component of the NHEJ complex includes PAXX (PubMed:25574025, PubMed:25941166). Following autophosphorylation, PRKDC dissociates from DNA (PubMed:33854234). Interacts with DNA-PKcs-interacting protein (KIP) with the region upstream the kinase domain (PubMed:9372844). PRKDC alone also interacts with and phosphorylates DCLRE1C, thereby activating the latent endonuclease activity of this protein (PubMed:11955432, PubMed:14744996, PubMed:15071507, PubMed:15456891, PubMed:15574326, PubMed:15811628, PubMed:15936993). Interacts with C1D (PubMed:9679063). Interacts with TTI1 and TELO2 (PubMed:20427287, PubMed:20801936, PubMed:20810650). Interacts with CIB1 (PubMed:9372844). Interacts with SETX (PubMed:23149945). Interacts with NR4A3; the DNA-dependent protein kinase complex DNA-PK phosphorylates and activates NR4A3 and prevents NR4A3 ubiquitination and degradation (PubMed:25852083). Interacts with BRAT1 (PubMed:22977523). Part of the HDP-RNP complex composed of at least HEXIM1, PRKDC, XRCC5, XRCC6, paraspeckle proteins (SFPQ, NONO, PSPC1, RBM14, and MATR3) and NEAT1 RNA (PubMed:28712728). Interacts with KAT5 (PubMed:32832608)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P78527-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":4097,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000338368.7"],"refseq":["NM_001081640.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001075109.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,3798],[3799,3830,299]],"edits":[{"start":3799,"end":3829,"original":"RLGLIEWLENTVTLKDLLLNTMSQEEKAAYL","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":31,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":null,"foldedMissing":null,"features":[[34,31,0],[37,1,0]],"in